# Private AQ host V3

Original signed Weston hostV2 API and source stay immutable. This adapter selects
only the new frozen aquamarine-nested-lifecycle-v1 library in the explicit
/usr/bin/Hyprland child, refuses a missing/non-Wayland AQ_BACKENDS value before
launch, and isolates settings with GSETTINGS_BACKEND=memory. Weston, private bus,
fixtures and the main compositor retain their own libraries and environments.
The private library enforces mandatory parent selection before constructing any
backend and gates buffers on the initial xdg configure ACK/publication. Require
actual healthy native output feedback and absence of DRM/libseat/protocol errors
in addition to exact process library mapping. Scope, runtime, parent peer,
Xwayland, teardown and immutable transitive input guards are unchanged.
